## Section

More content. You can use standard Markdown — links, code blocks, images, etc.

```ts
// Code blocks work as expected
const x = 42;
```

When ready to publish:
1. Rename this file to <slug>.mdx
2. Add a matching entry to src/content/posts.json
3. Run: node scripts/generate-rss.js && node scripts/generate-sitemap.js

Google Docs/Sheets publishing can generate these files instead:
1. Add a row to the blog Google Sheet
2. Put the Google Doc ID or URL in google_doc_id
3. Set published to true
4. Run: GOOGLE_BLOG_SHEET_ID=<sheet-id> npm run sync-blogs
